MiniMax Music 3 nodes
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The nodes in nodes/minimax_music3.py wrap minimax-music3-mlx, an independent Apple
MLX inference port by mikolaj92, used as a dependency and not vendored here:

    https://github.com/mikolaj92/minimax-music3-mlx
    Copyright 2026 mikolaj92, Apache License 2.0

patches/minimax-mlx-progress.patch is a derivative of that project, offered upstream
as https://github.com/mikolaj92/minimax-music3-mlx/pull/1 and carried here only until
it is merged.

MiniMax-Music3 model weights, tokenizer, and official inference contract are
Copyright (c) 2026 MiniMax, licensed under the MiniMax-Music3 Community License:

    https://huggingface.co/MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-Music3

Weights are downloaded by the user from Hugging Face and are never redistributed by
this project. Commercial products shipping the model must display "MiniMax-Music3";
yearly revenue above USD 20M requires separate MiniMax authorization (api@minimax.io).

MLX-converted weights used by these nodes are published by mikoy92:

    https://huggingface.co/collections/mikoy92/minimax-music-3-mlx-6a7eb2a8e09d246e6d029fad

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Upstream lineage (as documented by minimax-music3-mlx)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

MiniMax-Music3 was fine-tuned from Qwen3-8B (Apache License 2.0).
The flow-matching DiT is adapted from Stable Audio tools (MIT).
The vocoder is adapted from Descript Audio Codec (MIT).

